1. Introduction
This repository is a collection of projects developed using the Microsoft .NET and ASP.NET Core ecosystem. It demonstrates practical implementation of modern web application development, RESTful API development, database integration, and automated software testing.
The repository consists of three major components:
•	A web-based Help Desk Ticket Management System developed using ASP.NET Core MVC.
•	A RESTful ASP.NET Core Web API designed to provide backend services and CRUD functionality.
•	An xUnit Test Project created to perform automated unit testing and validate application functionality.
Together, these projects demonstrate the complete development lifecycle of a modern .NET-based application, from building the user interface and backend services to testing application logic.
The projects use technologies such as C#, ASP.NET Core, Entity Framework Core, Microsoft SQL Server, Razor Views, Bootstrap, Swagger/OpenAPI, and xUnit.net.
________________________________________
